">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\geq1\">\\(k\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 元关系符号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(R,\\bar x)\">\\(\\varphi(R,\\bar x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\">\\(R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0de5e873dd7a7151\" href=\"?note=0de5e873dd7a7151\" title=\"29-df-inductive-def\">29-df-inductive-def</a> 的全部条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中仅正出现，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0d59539a54286933\" href=\"?note=0d59539a54286933\" title=\"29-df-positivity\">29-df-positivity</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq|A|^k\\mid F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(X)\\subseteq X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq|A|^k\\mid F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(X)\\subseteq X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi))=\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi))=\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 4.3 与 Definition 4.5，印刷页 58–59，扫描页 73–74。对公式结构归纳可知正性蕴含单调性；收敛和最小性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ef09f4563b20da8e\" href=\"?note=ef09f4563b20da8e\" title=\"29-thm-finite-lfp\">29-thm-finite-lfp</a> 保证。本条只在有限结构上定义，未把可数次迭代的结论延伸到任意无限结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-inductive-def]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-positivity]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-finite-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"ef09f4563b20da8e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-thm-finite-lfp]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-inductive-def","status":"resolved","id":"0de5e873dd7a7151","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi(R,\\bar x)$、$F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$ 与 $R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}$ 满足 [[29-df-inductive-def]] 的全部条件。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-positivity","status":"resolved","id":"0d59539a54286933","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R$ 在 $\\varphi$ 中仅正出现，见 [[29-df-positivity]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-finite-lfp","status":"resolved","id":"ef09f4563b20da8e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"原书 Theorem 4.3 与 Definition 4.5，印刷页 58–59，扫描页 73–74。对公式结构归纳可知正性蕴含单调性；收敛和最小性由 [[29-thm-finite-lfp]] 保证。本条只在有限结构上定义，未把可数次迭代的结论延伸到任意无限结构。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"k\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(R,\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}R_i^{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}=\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq|A|^k\\mid F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(X)\\subseteq X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"F_{A,R,\\bar x,\\varphi}(\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi))=\\operatorname{LFP}_{A,R,\\bar x}(\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1614,"backlinks":[{"id":"d8799e17a4ba0440","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LFP}$ 的有限单调算子接口见 [[29-df-lfp]]；下式用 $\\mathrm{LFP}$ 标记这一种扩张语义。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-lfp]]、[[29-df-pfp]]、[[29-df-tc]] — LFP、PFP、TC 算子"},{"id":"805a7de3b1249a36","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-lfp]]"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-92","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-lfp]]"}],"outgoing":["0de5e873dd7a7151","0d59539a54286933","ef09f4563b20da8e"]}